This repository is an independent .NET integration for OpenUSD. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Pixar, Unity, NVIDIA, or the Alliance for OpenUSD.

The native runtime is built from Pixar OpenUSD, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Exact source
URLs, revisions, and archive SHA-256 hashes are pinned in eng/openusd.lock.json.

Runtime packages also include THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md generated from the locked native install.

The quarantined cesium-native build is separate from the core runtime and is built from CesiumGS
cesium-native v0.63.0, licensed under Apache-2.0. cesium-native's transitive vcpkg dependency set is
pinned by eng/cesium.lock.json and the vcpkg baseline recorded there. Packaging is deferred until a
C ABI shim links cesium-native into a runtime shared library. Generated build notices contain the
full copyright and license texts. The locked dependency licenses are:

